  "question": "Within a radius of 60 kilometers, where can I locate hotel heading toward Bunker Hill, IL from Money Museum, Chicago, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.632568 41.87833)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.792654 42.01126)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'hotel'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.632568 41.87833)',4326)::geography, 60000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.632568 41.87833)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
